WEBVTT

00:22:59.246 --> 00:23:04.038
I can also think of times when there
were paths we were on and

00:23:04.746 --> 00:23:10.371
the ability to switch it up and rethink
something might not have been for

00:23:10.371 --> 00:23:10.829
the best.

00:23:10.871 --> 00:23:13.163
Yeah, this is one of the
hardest questions that

00:23:13.163 --> 00:23:17.246
I really wrestled with while writing the
book and I'm still grappling with now,

00:23:17.246 --> 00:23:20.788
which is how much rethinking is
too much and how do I know

00:23:20.788 --> 00:23:23.163
whether when I've started
rethinking something,

00:23:23.163 --> 00:23:27.621
I should actually change my mind or go
back to my original first answer and

00:23:27.871 --> 00:23:32.704
the only coherent place that I've landed
on this so far as to say, well,